{"seq":1,"slug":"kv-quantization","title":"KV 量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/compression/kv-quantization","wordCount":1408,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"kv-量化\">KV 量化</h1><p>把 KV 缓存从 FP16 压到 INT4，显存直接砍到四分之一，解码还顺带提速——这听起来像免费午餐，直到你发现一个反直觉的细节：Key 和 Value 不能用同一种量化方式。2024 年的 KIVI 工作把这件事讲透了，并做到 2 比特几乎无损。这一篇讲清量化为什么对 KV 缓存特别有效，以及那个&quot;非对称&quot;的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量化就是把高精度浮点数映射到低比特整数。最常见的是对称仿射量化：给定一组数，找到其绝对值最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，用它定一个缩放因子，把浮点压进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 比特整数范围：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_q = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x}{s}\\right), \\quad s = \\frac{\\max|x|}{2^{b-1}-1}, \\quad \\hat{x} = s \\cdot x_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，压缩越狠，但量化误差越大。KV 量化的魅力在于：缓存是推理时动态产生的张量，量化它<strong>不需要重训模型</strong>、不碰权重，纯运行时操作。而且因为解码是<a href=\"../foundations/prefill-decode-cache\">带宽受限</a>的，缓存压到一半字节，要从显存搬的数据就少一半，延迟也跟着降——这是它区别于其它压缩手段、能同时打中显存与速度的根因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比特数</th>\n<th>相对 FP16 显存</th>\n<th>典型精度损失</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP16/BF16</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>无（基线）</td>\n<td>精度优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>几乎无损</td>\n<td>通用、最稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>小（需细粒度）</td>\n<td>显存紧张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT2</td>\n<td>12.5%</td>\n<td>中（需非对称策略）</td>\n<td>极限长上下文</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-key-和-value-要分开量化\">为什么 Key 和 Value 要分开量化</h2><p>这是 KV 量化最核心、也最容易被忽略的洞察。把缓存张量按&quot;通道&quot;（每个特征维度）和&quot;token&quot;（每个时间步）两个方向看，会发现 Key 和 Value 的离群值分布截然不同：<strong>Key 张量在某些通道上有持续的大离群值</strong>（某几个特征维度的值系统性偏大），而 <strong>Value 张量的离群值更随机、更分散</strong>。</p>\n<p>离群值是量化的天敌——一个超大值会把缩放因子拉大，让其余正常值挤进很窄的整数区间，损失精度。所以正确的做法是顺着离群值的方向去切量化粒度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Key 按通道量化（per-channel）</strong>：每个通道单独算缩放因子，把&quot;某通道整体偏大&quot;这件事吸收掉。</li>\n<li><strong>Value 按 token 量化（per-token）</strong>：每个 token 单独算缩放因子，适配其分散的离群值。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[KV 缓存张量] --&gt; B[Key 张量]&#10;  A --&gt; C[Value 张量]&#10;  B --&gt; D[离群值集中在固定通道]&#10;  C --&gt; E[离群值随机分散]&#10;  D --&gt; F[按通道量化&lt;br/&gt;每通道一个缩放因子]&#10;  E --&gt; G[按 token 量化&lt;br/&gt;每 token 一个缩放因子]&#10;  F --&gt; H[2bit 几乎无损]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[KV 缓存张量] --&gt; B[Key 张量]\n  A --&gt; C[Value 张量]\n  B --&gt; D[离群值集中在固定通道]\n  C --&gt; E[离群值随机分散]\n  D --&gt; F[按通道量化&lt;br/&gt;每通道一个缩放因子]\n  E --&gt; G[按 token 量化&lt;br/&gt;每 token 一个缩放因子]\n  F --&gt; H[2bit 几乎无损]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>这种&quot;K 走通道、V 走 token&quot;的非对称策略，正是 KIVI（ICML 2024）的核心。据其报告，它让 Llama-2、Falcon、Mistral 等模型在 2 比特下保持几乎相同的质量，峰值显存降到 1/2.6（含权重），从而支持 4 倍的批量，带来 2.35 至 3.47 倍的真实吞吐提升（来源：KIVI 论文 arxiv.org/abs/2402.02750）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"细粒度量化与离群值保留\">细粒度量化与离群值保留</h2><p>继续往下挖，2 比特要做到无损还得靠两个补充技巧。其一是<strong>分组量化（group-wise）</strong>：不对整条通道/token 用一个缩放因子，而是切成小组（如每 32 或 64 个数一组），每组一个因子，进一步贴合局部分布。组越小越精确，但缩放因子的存储与计算开销越大，这是个需要调的旋钮。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>离群值保留</strong>。KVQuant（NeurIPS 2024）的思路是：识别出极少数离群值，对它们用全精度单独存（稀疏地），其余绝大多数正常值才低比特量化。它还结合了 pre-RoPE 量化（在旋转位置编码之前量化 Key，因为 RoPE 会打乱通道结构）和非均匀量化，据报告把上下文长度推到千万 token 级（来源：KVQuant，stat.berkeley.edu/~mmahoney KVQuant 论文）。这些技巧的共同主题是：<strong>别用一刀切的量化对付分布不均的数据</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时用-用到几比特\">何时用、用到几比特</h2><p>量化不是越激进越好，要按场景定档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>INT8</strong>：几乎零损失，是最稳妥的默认起点。显存减半，绝大多数业务可无脑上。</li>\n<li><strong>INT4 + 分组</strong>：显存到 1/4，长上下文或高并发场景的主力档位，需配细粒度分组控误差。</li>\n<li><strong>INT2 + 非对称 + 离群保留</strong>：极限场景（百万 token、显存极度紧张）才动用，对实现要求高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>量化与本章其它手段是正交的、可叠加：先用<a href=\"gqa-mqa-cache\">GQA/MQA 与缓存缩减</a>从架构上减少键值头数，再量化每个数的字节数，两者乘起来。它也和<a href=\"../practice/kv-offloading\">KV 卸载与分层</a>配合——量化后再卸载，PCIe 上要搬的数据更少。注意与<a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/quantization/quantization-principle\">模型压缩 hub</a>区分：那里量化的是静态权重，这里量化的是运行时动态 KV，分布特性与策略都不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>KV 量化把缓存映射到低比特整数，不需重训、纯运行时操作，且因解码带宽受限而同时降显存与延迟。</li>\n<li>核心洞察：Key 离群值集中在固定通道、Value 离群值分散，所以 Key 按通道、Value 按 token 量化（KIVI 的非对称策略），2 比特几乎无损。</li>\n<li>分组量化与离群值保留进一步控制误差，KVQuant 借此推到千万 token 上下文。</li>\n<li>实践档位：INT8 稳妥默认、INT4+分组主力、INT2+非对称仅极限场景。</li>\n<li>量化与 GQA、卸载正交可叠加；与权重量化对象不同，不要混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"gqa-mqa-cache\">GQA/MQA 与缓存缩减</a>（架构层减键值头，可与量化叠加）、<a href=\"../foundations/prefill-decode-cache\">预填充与解码阶段</a>（带宽受限解释量化为何降延迟）、<a href=\"../practice/kv-offloading\">KV 卸载与分层</a>（量化后卸载省传输）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/quantization/quantization-principle\">模型压缩与推理 · 量化原理</a> 对比权重量化与 KV 量化的异同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"KV 量化","id":"kv-量化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 Key 和 Value 要分开量化","id":"为什么-key-和-value-要分开量化"},{"level":2,"text":"细粒度量化与离群值保留","id":"细粒度量化与离群值保留"},{"level":2,"text":"何时用、用到几比特","id":"何时用-用到几比特"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"碎片与分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/memory/fragmentation-allocation"},"next":{"title":"驱逐与稀疏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/kv-cache-optimization/compression/kv-eviction-sparsity"}}